    <string name="tool_picture_overscan">Overscan and geometry</string>
    <string name="tool_picture_overscan_desc">A 1-pixel border on the exact edge of the picture and marks at 2.5%% (yellow) and 5%% (blue) from each side show how much the TV crops. The center circle must look round, and the square must have equal sides.</string>
    <string name="tool_picture_overscan_hint">Border: edge of the picture · yellow: 2.5%% · blue: 5%%</string>
    <string name="tool_picture_motion">Motion</string>
    <string name="tool_picture_motion_desc">A block and a text cross the screen at constant speed, to show blur, trails and judder. Up and Down change the speed. The counter shows dropped frames (33 ms or more), including those caused by Lume itself.</string>
    <string name="tool_picture_motion_sample">Moving text</string>
